    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 3391366fc7886fb09834ebee2d39ef45ccef9242 -->\n**Read-only delta re-check** (not rebuilt, no checkout). Last reviewed at 795733e7, now at 3391366f.\n\n**Verdict: Ready for the maintainer to merge once the PROCESS_VERSION request below is made.** No code blocker; the one request is a process number.\n\n**Delta since 795733e7**\n- No new non-merge commit of this PR's own. The range holds merges of main and of the #922 refresh (34c38d10, 8092d11d, 5449e26e, 3391366f) plus main's own commits, which are already on main.\n- Combined hunks of every merge: the only hand-resolved hunk is `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`. No code hunk was resolved by hand, and no line of this PR's change or of main's was dropped or altered.\n- `git diff origin/main...3391366f` (main 9032da34) is only this PR's files: `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`, `docs/decisions/923-asset-gate.md`, `xtask/src/{asset_tests,assets,main,quick}.rs`. No snapshot PNG, no workflow file.\n- Trial merge against current main (in memory): clean.\n\n**Process version**\n- Head: 20. Main: 20 (9032da34).\n- Requested change: a merged process PR must end above main's number. Bump to the next free number (21 at this moment) with your next merge of main. #972 and #1033 are stacked above this one, so they renumber after it.\n\n**Merge order** (as stated in the body): #967, then #972, then #1033.\n\n**Requested before merge**\n1. `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` (line 1): 20 equals main's 20; take the next free number above main.\n\n**Notes (not blocking)**\n- The `xtask` gate-map and quick-plan changes are unchanged since the last review.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
